ripwire: --limit/--offset are honored only by: --lint --hotspots --callers --callees --tree --deps --cochange --owners --clones --doc-drift --communities --community --whereis --grep/--regex --match --pattern --impact --uses --exercises --seams --zoom --external-surface --dead-code --mentions --graph-query --stray-content --test-gate --readability --ensemble --quality-panel --context-ratio --nonlocal-state --comment-coherence --naming-consistency --safe-delete --pr-context. The default map is bounded by --top-k=N (or --max-tokens=N) and --recall by --top-k=N, not --limit; the rest emit a fixed report with no page to walk
